      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAT MATSON (2) has had a series of wider or second line draws so is much better served by this barrier. Took on a higher-graded race last time but did a good job to finish fourth at Newcastle two runs ago to follow a second from the back row at this venue. Should get his chance to show his best here. LIMOUSINE CHEEKY (4) drew on the back row and raced three wide without cover last start so wasn't disgraced in finishing midfield. Was racing consistently with a series of top-four results prior. Major player. LEAVE IT TO LUCY (9) has been solid since a win at this circuit and distance last month. Tricky draw but is suited coming back in grade off the last-start placing. The ace draw can see big improvement from TINNY MAHONEY (1).",
